<title>USA: DXP buys Strategic Distribution unit.</title>
<headline>DXP buys Strategic Distribution unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>DXP Enterprises Inc said Wednesday it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Strategic Supply Inc, a subsidiary of Strategic Distribution Inc .</p>
<p>Strategic Supply had revenues of about $50 million for fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Strategic Supply is a full-service, traditional distribution company specializing in the distribution of safety equipment and general mill supplies.</p>
</text>
